@CourtMate_HostAddress = http://localhost:5044

### Lista użytkowników
GET {{CourtMate_HostAddress}}/api/users

### Lista lig
GET {{CourtMate_HostAddress}}/api/leagues

### Tabela ligowa (użyj ID ligi z powyższego zapytania)
GET {{CourtMate_HostAddress}}/api/leagues/{{leagueId}}/standings

### Mecze w lidze
GET {{CourtMate_HostAddress}}/api/leagues/{{leagueId}}/matches

### Nowy użytkownik
POST {{CourtMate_HostAddress}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "User",
  "password": "secret"
}

### Nowa liga
POST {{CourtMate_HostAddress}}/api/leagues
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "leagueName": "Liga Letnia 2026",
  "playerIds": []
}

### Zaplanuj mecz
POST {{CourtMate_HostAddress}}/api/leagues/{{leagueId}}/matches
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "player1Id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "player2Id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "date": "2026-07-01T18:00:00Z"
}

### Wpisz wynik meczu
PUT {{CourtMate_HostAddress}}/api/leagues/{{leagueId}}/matches/{{matchId}}/score
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Completed",
  "sets": [
    { "player1Games": 6, "player2Games": 4 },
    { "player1Games": 6, "player2Games": 2 }
  ],
  "winnerId": null
}
